
# `.secrets.baseline` carries a `generated_at` clock that detect-secrets
# rewrites whenever any scanned file's line numbers move, so two branches
# that both touched scanned files always conflict on that one line even when
# their findings are identical. The driver unions the findings and keeps the
# later stamp; see scripts/git/merge-secrets-baseline.py for why not
# `ours`/`union`, and docs/development.md for the one-time registration.
.secrets.baseline merge=secrets-baseline
